{"availability":"available","full":"TencentARC/SCoPE","name":"SCoPE","description":"SCoPE: Sightline-Coordinate Positional Encoding for 3D-Aware Video Generation","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":214,"forks":15,"created":"2026-08-12T02:04:25Z","updated":"2026-09-27T07:44:27Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://visual-ai.github.io/scope/","topics":["3d","dit","novel-view-synthesis","video-diffusion","video-diffusion-model","world-models"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/TencentARC/scope-camera-video-generation","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:22.318Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:22.318Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:22.318Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:45.587Z","stars":214,"forks":14},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:58:22.318Z","stars":214,"forks":15}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Minghao Yin · Jiahao Lu · Wenbo Hu · Wang Zhao · Ying Shan · Kai Han","SCoPE adds camera sightlines as positional coordinates to a pretrained video diffusion transformer. Given a first frame, a text prompt, and a camera trajectory, it generates a video that follows the requested camera motion while preserving the original image-to-video prior.","Video diffusion transformers address their tokens by position on the pixel-time grid: an address in the tensor, not in the world. The world point a token depicts lies on a surface that has not been generated yet, but its camera ray is fixed the moment the user specifies a trajectory. SCoPE therefore treats the ray as a second positional coordinate, so camera control becomes a property of the coordinate system rather than an added module."],"features":["Camera motion as coordinates. Each video token is tied to its camera ray via Plücker","Robust to heterogeneous pose sources. The per-clip near-depth normalization plus the learned","Self-contained Wan2.2-I2V-A14B release. The model repository contains everything required for"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TencentARC/SCoPE/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c88fe1631eb5a137d12005d06a2a166788bd58c732eb19eb74525faf44420d82","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:45.726Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:45.726Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Minghao Yin · Jiahao Lu · Wenbo Hu · Wang Zhao · Ying Shan · Kai Han","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TencentARC/SCoPE/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c88fe1631eb5a137d12005d06a2a166788bd58c732eb19eb74525faf44420d82","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TencentARC/SCoPE/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:45.726Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-27T07:44:27Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TencentARC/SCoPE/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:45.727Z","hash":"c88fe1631eb5a137d12005d06a2a166788bd58c732eb19eb74525faf44420d82","originalBytes":17041,"storedBytes":17041,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:45.587Z","subjects":["Image, audio & video AI","3D & graphics"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"AI & machine learning","subjects":["Image, audio & video AI","3D & graphics"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Image, audio & video AI","source":"metadata","match":"Video Generation"},{"subject":"3D & graphics","source":"metadata","match":"3D"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automotive","Maths & algorithms"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/TencentARC/scope-camera-video-generation","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T05:16:28.635Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T05:16:28.635Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-18T05:16:28.635Z","target":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/TencentARC/scope-camera-video-generation","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-25